// Verified user: your backend calls GET …/bridge/user with launch_token`,guide_dev_user_title:"User info — two levels",guide_dev_user_1:"UI only: getDisplayUser() or display_user on bridge:ready — greetings and labels inside your app.",guide_dev_user_2:"Trusted: your publisher backend calls GET bridge/user with the launch_token (needs user.read on the token).",guide_dev_user_3:"Never use display_user for authorization. Always handle denied permissions gracefully.",guide_dev_desktop_title:"Messages to desktop",guide_dev_desktop_1:"sendDesktopMessage sends banners or hints on the Hub desktop work area.",guide_dev_desktop_2:"Notifications use POST bridge/notify from your publisher backend — not AppHubBridge.notify.",guide_dev_desktop_3:"setTaskbarBadge(count) updates your app on the taskbar when desktop.badge is granted.",guide_dev_deploy_title:"Publish to App Hub",guide_dev_deploy_1:"Hosted: build dist → zip with manifest.json (runtime_type: hosted) → drop on desktop → DEV approves → appears in store.",guide_dev_deploy_2:"Iframe: host your SPA → manifest with runtime_type: iframe and entry_url (HTTPS) → drop manifest or POST /apps/register → DEV approves.",guide_dev_deploy_3:"List permissions and api_urls in manifest.json. Bump version when you re-publish.",guide_dev_docs_title:"Machine-readable reference (AI & tools)",guide_dev_docs_1:"Need the full reference? Open it below — written for humans, always synced with the latest publisher contract.",guide_dev_docs_link:"Open full publisher reference",guide_dev_docs_2:"Covers runtime types, bridge, permissions, manifest, and how to publish.",guide_dev_docs_3:"Quick start is in the sections above; the full reference loads on demand.",guide_dev_docs_panel_title:"Full publisher reference",guide_dev_docs_close:"Close",guide_dev_docs_loading:"Loading publisher reference…",guide_dev_docs_ai_note_before:"AI coding tools use",guide_dev_docs_ai_note_after:"(JSON). That machine format is not shown here.",guide_dev_docs_error_no_ap